Package: atlaspercolation
Type: Package
Title: Reference Core for the Percolation Atlas
Version: 1.4.7
Authors@R: person("Atlas Percolation contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Base-R implementation of the Bernoulli core and Newman-Ziff
    sweep used by the Percolation Atlas. The same random stream, lattice edge
    order and crossing definitions are used by the C++, Julia, Python and Java
    editions.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
